	ther tools and tips that will enhance your Microsoft Office Suite knowledg
	e to help ensure your computer interaction is less stress and ready for su
	ccess! \nPlease note\, a basic level of knowledge of JAWS is required to t
	ake this class. We offer training classes on JAWS\; please contact us for 
	more information. \nRegister Online\n\n\n                \n               
